export anchor ArchitecturalStyle:
    number: 42
    screen: ProjectDetail
    name: Architectural
    idea: The project is laid out like a floor plan on a drawing sheet, with hairline walls between numbered rooms, grid bubbles, a dimension line timeline, a scale bar and a title block, all in lowercase geometric type.
    base: light
    palette:
        white: #ffffff, the page and the rooms
        ink: #1a1a1a, text, walls, the primary button and the scale bar
        grey: #666666, labels, dates, assignees and grid leaders
        hairline: #d4d4d4, row dividers inside rooms and link underlines
        faint: #f4f4f2, the fill of a focused list row
        markupRed: #b3261e, the blocked word and symbol only, like a redline
    type:
        One geometric sans, Futura, "Futura PT", "Century Gothic", "Avenir
        Next", Avenir, "URW Gothic", "Trebuchet MS", sans-serif, with all
        text lowercase. Weight is 300 for text and 400 for labels. Sizes are
        44px for the title, 64px for the percent figure, 19px for the brief
        and quote, 15px body at 1.6 line height, and 11px labels with 0.18em
        tracking. File names are a small monospace.
    layout:
        A sparse top line holds the widely tracked brightwork wordmark,
        grey nav links with the current one underlined, an underline search
        field and the user name. The title sits left with the buttons right.
        The plan is a four column grid of rooms drawn with shared 1px ink
        walls. Circled grid bubbles a to d sit above the column lines and 1
        to 3 left of the rows, joined by dashed leaders. Row 1 holds 01 brief
        across two columns, 02 status and 03 people. Row 2 holds 04
        milestones as a dimension line with slashed ticks, and 05 open tasks.
        Row 3 holds 06 files, 07 discussion and a title block with project,
        team, owner, viewer, sheet and a north arrow. A scale bar of
        alternating black and white segments from 0 to 25 tasks marks 18 done
        below the plan. Below 1000px the rooms go two across, and below 640px
        the bubbles hide and the rooms stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 22 to 26px room padding, 36 to 56px between major blocks and a 44px gutter for the grid markers.
    density: Sparse with lots of white and few items per room.
    corners: Square. Only the grid bubbles are round.
    borders: 1px ink walls shared between rooms, 1px light grey rows inside rooms and dashed grey grid leaders.
    shadows: None.
    icons:
        Tiny 11px drawn glyphs beside words, a tick for on track, a filled
        square for done, a half filled square for in progress, a hollow
        square for planned and a slashed circle for blocked. People show as
        lowercase initials in square frames.
    focus: A 1.5px ink outline offset 4px. Fields also thicken their underline to 2px.
    tone: Lowercase nouns over sentences, numbered like drawing references, such as 05 open tasks.
